Imports the three layers of the recognition interface:

* `Poincare.D7.Recognition.Basic` — certificate vocabulary;
* `Poincare.D7.Recognition.Assembly` — the end-game logical assembly;
* `Poincare.D7.Recognition.Homeomorphism` — the statement-only final homeomorphism
  construction and its named missing inputs.
